            {
                "entry_id": "14eabbda-c90d-396a-a229-266951437903",
                "word": "thraldom",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b73235a1-df76-4b51-a5b9-ae5c9ae486de",
                        "entry_id": "14eabbda-c90d-396a-a229-266951437903",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "thraldoms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "585df119-29a2-3f58-9392-569c265b4eb2",
                        "entry_id": "14eabbda-c90d-396a-a229-266951437903",
                        "glosses": [
                            "對他人處於束縛、奴役或屈從的狀態"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ada73c72-00b3-4bd3-9cb1-71fb76931586",
                                "sense_id": "585df119-29a2-3f58-9392-569c265b4eb2",
                                "text": "For ye into like thraldome me did throw,\nAnd kept from complishing the faith which I did owe.",
                                "translation": "因為你將我投入了同樣的奴役之中，\n並阻止我實現我應盡的忠誠。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bfd332b-70f4-487d-9679-63328b68f33b",
                                "sense_id": "585df119-29a2-3f58-9392-569c265b4eb2",
                                "text": "Beauteous Penthea […] is novv ſo yoak'd / To a moſt barbarous thraldome, miſery, / Affliction, that [s]he ſauors not humanity.",
                                "translation": "美麗的潘西亞（Penthea）……現在被束縛在／最野蠻的奴役、苦難／與折磨之中，以至於她已感受不到人情。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6dce141f-49e7-468a-af8c-d4cd4a16501e",
                                "sense_id": "585df119-29a2-3f58-9392-569c265b4eb2",
                                "text": "The wretched thraldom was over,—and what had it left?",
                                "translation": "這悲慘的奴役已經結束，——但它留下了什麼？"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
